<title>UK: Cookson names Howard new chief executive.</title>
<headline>Cookson names Howard new chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British electronic and plastic industrial materials company Cookson Group Plc said on Thursday that Stephen Howard, its joint group managing director will be appointed group chief executive with effect from October 1, 1997.  </p>
<p>On that day Richard Oster, the current chief executive will become chairman, taking over from Robert Malpas who will retire from his post.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
